 "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/cf348a375ab3260e69384574095050c7.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/cf348a375ab3260e69384574095050c7.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p></p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/d6414221cdfbf3bbe5d8c81ecc495102.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/d6414221cdfbf3bbe5d8c81ecc495102.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《Seaside Wash》</strong>将身临其境的清洗音效与舒缓的背景音乐相结合，营造出一种宁静而引人入胜的体验。随着锈迹斑斑、破旧不堪的船只逐渐恢复如新，每项任务都能带来令人满足的成就感。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/6dd54e609e9c87404a602d37df50f139.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/6dd54e609e9c87404a602d37df50f139.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不同的表面和污渍需要不同的清洁工具。请明智地选择，以达到最佳清洁效果，因为每项清洁任务都需要合适的设备和方法才能取得最佳效果。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/425da3f9769e51130c2cf98c2342bc11.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/425da3f9769e51130c2cf98c2342bc11.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过升级和维修工具来提升工作效率，从而胜任更具挑战性且回报更丰厚的任务。随着修复任务的难度不断提升，解锁更优质的工具并优化你的工作方法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/a20108fd916d4895a48274a3a542a2fc.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/a20108fd916d4895a48274a3a542a2fc.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >您将有机会在各种船只上工作，从小型渔船到巨型货轮。每艘船都有其独特的结构、规模以及待修复的清洁难题。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/405f52ee2b573a26d28a2d4f4730909f.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/405f52ee2b573a26d28a2d4f4730909f.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >彻底清洁船上的每个角落，从船体和船首到桅杆、甲板以及内部空间。探索那些布满污垢、藏有死角且充满修复乐趣的精细作业区域。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c6211dd9a8dea5268cb36ddff5d0521.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/4c6211dd9a8dea5268cb36ddff5d0521.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >应对盐渍、锈迹和顽固的藤壶等不同污垢层，这些污垢需要采取不同的清洁策略。了解每种污垢的特性，并选择最佳方法将其有效清除。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/18c49c7e324d03409d7d65181728b2cd.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/18c49c7e324d03409d7d65181728b2cd.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >按照自己的节奏接单，选择适合你的工具、策略和时间的任务。在完成各种任务的同时，自由地提升进度，建立声誉并升级你的工坊。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/70f29a7bbd3817d2ab13b3aef7ba619d.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/70f29a7bbd3817d2ab13b3aef7ba619d.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在工作间隙，回到你舒适的海边小屋，通过钓鱼和烹饪等轻松的小游戏放松身心。享受宁静的海边时光，让日常的修复工作暂且搁置，尽享一段令人神清气爽的休憩时光。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>游戏特色</strong>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛥️ 在沉浸式且细节丰富的作业环境中修复各类船只</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧰 使用专业工具和车间系统处理棘手的修复任务</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 通过富有成就感的升级机制提升并扩展你的工作空间</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 在多层级的室内外海滨区域开展工作</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌤️ 体验动态天气、昼夜循环以及令人放松的海滨活动</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >做好准备，别忘了加入我们的 Discord 频道，随时掌握《Seaside Wash》的最新消息和更新！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/d6414221cdfbf3bbe5d8c81ecc495102.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/d6414221cdfbf3bbe5d8c81ecc495102.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《Seaside Wash》</strong>将身临其境的清洗音效与舒缓的背景音乐相结合，营造出一种宁静而引人入胜的体验。随着锈迹斑斑、破旧不堪的船只逐渐恢复如新，每项任务都能带来令人满足的成就感。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/6dd54e609e9c87404a602d37df50f139.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/6dd54e609e9c87404a602d37df50f139.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不同的表面和污渍需要不同的清洁工具。请明智地选择，以达到最佳清洁效果，因为每项清洁任务都需要合适的设备和方法才能取得最佳效果。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/425da3f9769e51130c2cf98c2342bc11.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/425da3f9769e51130c2cf98c2342bc11.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过升级和维修工具来提升工作效率，从而胜任更具挑战性且回报更丰厚的任务。随着修复任务的难度不断提升，解锁更优质的工具并优化你的工作方法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/a20108fd916d4895a48274a3a542a2fc.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/a20108fd916d4895a48274a3a542a2fc.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >您将有机会在各种船只上工作，从小型渔船到巨型货轮。每艘船都有其独特的结构、规模以及待修复的清洁难题。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/405f52ee2b573a26d28a2d4f4730909f.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/405f52ee2b573a26d28a2d4f4730909f.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >彻底清洁船上的每个角落，从船体和船首到桅杆、甲板以及内部空间。探索那些布满污垢、藏有死角且充满修复乐趣的精细作业区域。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c6211dd9a8dea5268cb36ddff5d0521.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/4c6211dd9a8dea5268cb36ddff5d0521.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >应对盐渍、锈迹和顽固的藤壶等不同污垢层，这些污垢需要采取不同的清洁策略。了解每种污垢的特性，并选择最佳方法将其有效清除。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/18c49c7e324d03409d7d65181728b2cd.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/18c49c7e324d03409d7d65181728b2cd.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >按照自己的节奏接单，选择适合你的工具、策略和时间的任务。在完成各种任务的同时，自由地提升进度，建立声誉并升级你的工坊。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/70f29a7bbd3817d2ab13b3aef7ba619d.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/70f29a7bbd3817d2ab13b3aef7ba619d.webp?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在工作间隙，回到你舒适的海边小屋，通过钓鱼和烹饪等轻松的小游戏放松身心。享受宁静的海边时光，让日常的修复工作暂且搁置，尽享一段令人神清气爽的休憩时光。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>游戏特色</strong>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛥️ 在沉浸式且细节丰富的作业环境中修复各类船只</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧰 使用专业工具和车间系统处理棘手的修复任务</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 通过富有成就感的升级机制提升并扩展你的工作空间</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 在多层级的室内外海滨区域开展工作</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌤️ 体验动态天气、昼夜循环以及令人放松的海滨活动</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >做好准备，别忘了加入我们的 Discord 频道，随时掌握《Seaside Wash》的最新消息和更新！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>",
 "short_description": "《Seaside Wash》是一款温馨的职业模拟游戏，你将在游戏中清洁、维修并修复船只，让它们从锈迹斑斑、布满藤壶的状态恢复到崭新如初。升级工具、拓展业务、发现稀有物品、打造属于自己的船只，并享受宁静的海滨生活。",
 "supported_languages": "英语, 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 印度尼西亚语, 日语, 韩语, 波兰语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 俄语, 简体中文, 泰语, 繁体中文, 土耳其语, 越南语",
